!docs/verification/
!docs/verification/**

# session scratch — OpenCode/Cursor debug & verification scripts
web/tmp-*.mjs
tmp-*.ts
tmp-*.mjs
tmp-*.js

# one-off verification harnesses + local process/debris (untracked scratch only —
